# Local secrets (not committed)

Copy this file to `project.local.md` and fill in real keys.

`project.local.md` is gitignored so keys don’t get committed.

- deepseek: <DEEPSEEK_API_KEY>
- openrouter: <OPENROUTER_API_KEY>
- moonshot: <KIMI_API_KEY_CN or MOONSHOT_API_KEY>
- git_remote: <YOUR_GIT_REMOTE_URL>

# For service installs running under a different user, you can point agentd at a specific dotenv file:
#   AGENTD_DOTENV_PATH=/path/to/.env
